    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;In the year 21XX, there is no rest for the dead\u2014only servitude.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ruled by an Emperor of unparalleled power, who commands the fate of millions in life\u2014but also after death. He promises safety and dominion. In return, he demands absolute obedience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a servitor\u2014stripped of your name, your past, and your future. Bound by laws you did not choose, you exist as one small cog in the vast Imperial machine. There is no room for hope. No place for choice. No path but the one carved for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026But between a preordained future and an immovable past, something glimmers with a tantalizing light\u2014something no one counted on you finding. An impossibly thin thread of liberation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A path beyond the possible.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey Through Oblivion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MORTAL ADVOCATE</i> is a <strong>narrative-driven 3D adventure</strong> exploring servitude, defiance, and the cost of selfhood. Navigate <strong>ash-smothered industrial ruins, asteroid mines beneath a canopy of glittering stars, and despair-soaked slums</strong> where memory, magic, and mortality intertwine. Face the might of an <strong>enormous Imperial system</strong> until despair boils over\u2014then decide what it truly means to be free.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Haunting Narrative</strong> \u2013 Uncover the hidden truths of the servitors, the Profane, the Holy, and the system that binds them all together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> \u2013 Traverse industrial ruins, asteroid mines, slums, and forgotten places where the past refuses to stay buried.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Philosophical Themes</strong> \u2013 Fate, identity, will, desire, and control shape your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Black &amp; White World</strong> \u2013 A stark, high-contrast visual style where only magic dares to shine in color.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sound Design</strong> \u2013 A melancholic score and ambient dread bring an undead world to life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The past binds. The future devours. <i>The cost of belief is everything.</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;In the year 21XX, there is no rest for the dead\u2014only servitude.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ruled by an Emperor of unparalleled power, who commands the fate of millions in life\u2014but also after death. He promises safety and dominion. In return, he demands absolute obedience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a servitor\u2014stripped of your name, your past, and your future. Bound by laws you did not choose, you exist as one small cog in the vast Imperial machine. There is no room for hope. No place for choice. No path but the one carved for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026But between a preordained future and an immovable past, something glimmers with a tantalizing light\u2014something no one counted on you finding. An impossibly thin thread of liberation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A path beyond the possible.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey Through Oblivion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MORTAL ADVOCATE</i> is a <strong>narrative-driven 3D adventure</strong> exploring servitude, defiance, and the cost of selfhood. Navigate <strong>ash-smothered industrial ruins, asteroid mines beneath a canopy of glittering stars, and despair-soaked slums</strong> where memory, magic, and mortality intertwine. Face the might of an <strong>enormous Imperial system</strong> until despair boils over\u2014then decide what it truly means to be free.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Haunting Narrative</strong> \u2013 Uncover the hidden truths of the servitors, the Profane, the Holy, and the system that binds them all together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> \u2013 Traverse industrial ruins, asteroid mines, slums, and forgotten places where the past refuses to stay buried.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Philosophical Themes</strong> \u2013 Fate, identity, will, desire, and control shape your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Black &amp; White World</strong> \u2013 A stark, high-contrast visual style where only magic dares to shine in color.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sound Design</strong> \u2013 A melancholic score and ambient dread bring an undead world to life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The past binds. The future devours. <i>The cost of belief is everything.</i></strong></p>",
